        {
          "kicker": "Ireland selection",
          "heading": "Ireland name Joey Carbery in XV squad to face Fiji A",
          "body": "Joey Carbery is in Mark Sexton's 28-man Ireland XV squad to meet Fiji A in Cork, a second-string side Andy Farrell is using to widen his pool before next year's Rugby World Cup. The 31-year-old out-half has not played for Ireland's senior side since 2022, when he won the last of his 38 caps against Fiji. Sexton said: \"This is a hugely important fixture for players to put their hands up and try to break into the senior Men's squad.\" Charlie O'Shea, the 20-year-old out-half, is left out."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Italy without 15 key men through injury, including captain Michele Lamaro",
          "body": "Borthwick rejects Shaun Edwards's offer of a role at England's World Cup. Springboks omit six uncapped players from Italy match-day squad."
        }
