          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Nolann Le Garrec's latest hamstring injury lets Paul Graou into France squad",
          "body": "La Rochelle's Nolann Le Garrec has suffered another hamstring injury, and Toulouse scrumhalf Paul Graou comes into the squad in his place. It is one of five additions Fabien Galthié has made to his 42-man group, which must first prepare for Fiji and then face the Springboks at the Stade de France. Argentina follow at the same ground."
