          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Erasmus restores Salmaan Moerat to Springboks XV for Italy clash",
          "body": "South Africa have officially named the side for Saturday's Turin Test, with lock Salmaan Moerat back from the neck and toe injuries that kept him out of the first leg of the Nations Championship. Moerat partners Ruan Nortjé in the second row, and Ethan Hooker is the only player retained from the September loss to Australia. Italy, meanwhile, have 15 key men unavailable through injury, including captain Michele Lamaro and Tommaso Menoncello."
        },
