          "kicker": "Pundit warning",
          "heading": "Matfield warns All Blacks Scotland could be bigger test than England",
          "body": "Speaking on the Rugby Rivals podcast, former Springbok lock Victor Matfield said Scotland might be a bigger challenge than England, pointing to the two URC clubs. He said the Scottish teams are \"really playing great and they're playing nice rugby.\" He noted Glasgow are unbeaten and Edinburgh were unbeaten before their Benetton loss. Former New Zealand wing John Kirwan agreed Scotland would be a serious threat."
