          "kicker": "Argentina XV test",
          "heading": "England A name eight Test-capped men for Argentina XV clash in Bath",
          "body": "Mark Mapletoft has named a 30-man group for the Argentina XV game at The Rec, with Caluori, Atkinson and Ojomoh among those who attended Steve Borthwick's three-day senior camp last week. Alongside them, Roots, Northmore, Blamire, Kloska and Carpenter make up the eight Test-capped men. Max Hicks, an English-qualified Newcastle Red Bulls forward, is arguably the headline pick, while Fitz Harding captains the side. Five players, Lucas Friday and James Pater among them, earn their first A call-ups."
        },
